Release: v1.5.0

This release extends v1.4.0 with DART/SEC-based research,
period-aware financial normalization and calculations,
issuer-level analysis and company-macro linkage, bounded
citation and linkage recovery, expanded diagnostics and
regression tests, and public-demo build configuration fixes.

Research outputs are automatically generated drafts. Completion
indicates execution status, not factual accuracy, investment
suitability, or complete coverage of all research topics.

